was also unusually dry. In Cologne, police are seeking a man who fired shots at a cafe storefront. DW has more.</summary><category term="News" /></entry><entry><title>In Saxony-Anhalt, Sven Schulze takes on far-right AfD</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:b59422cb3263c97716c3def623406ef655cd9008e1c9c282410c9be9e6932069</id><updated>2026-08-31T21:31:45Z</updated><published>2026-08-31T12:28:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/in-saxony-anhalt-sven-schulze-takes-on-far-right-afd/a-78509861--934d9ea40018.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/in-saxony-anhalt-sven-schulze-takes-on-far-right-afd/a-78509861?maca=en-rss-en-ger-1023-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">The AfD is way ahead in the polls in the eastern German state of Saxony-Anhalt. But the young incumbent state premier insists he can stop the far right from leading a government for the first time since World War II.</summary><category term="Germany" /></entry><entry><title>German churches speak out against AfD ahead of state election</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:08a7f43547d55acf6a5cc9c4b12c71afeebc6e40f60fb59fecbbd3e8d6e89d74</id><updated>2026-08-31T21:31:45Z</updated><published>2026-08-30T15:56:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/german-churches-speak-out-against-afd-ahead-of-state-election/a-78482465--9872affc1818.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/german-churches-speak-out-against-afd-ahead-of-state-election/a-78482465?maca=en-rss-en-ger-1023-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">As the far-right AfD party leads the polls ahead of Sunday's election in Saxony-Anhalt, church leaders have warned against downplaying its "ethnonationalist" agenda.</summary><category term="Germany" /></entry><entry><title>Saxony-Anhalt election: Why the AfD is so strong</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:22e0747610b3d78713a8b2bc980fa107cbb60589b477b507ef7337c12ad50f31</id><updated>2026-08-31T21:31:45Z</updated><published>2026-08-29T16:17:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/saxony-anhalt-election-why-the-afd-is-so-strong/a-78482588--a6821a9b3939.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/saxony-anhalt-election-why-the-afd-is-so-strong/a-78482588?maca=en-rss-en-ger-1023-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">The AfD is polling above 40% ahead of Saxony-Anhalt's election on September 6. What is driving support for the far right in this predominantly rural eastern German state?</summary><category term="Germany" /></entry><entry><title>This extremely successful author polarizes German readers</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:4765e6e6fad7586d29435c2658a2374d09b1ecddc0a542b7f9c814c2fb9465ab</id><updated>2026-08-31T21:31:45Z</updated><published>2026-08-29T07:20:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/this-extremely-successful-author-polarizes-german-readers/a-78500452--d7968a32f7c4.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/this-extremely-successful-author-polarizes-german-readers/a-78500452?maca=en-rss-en-ger-1023-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">She's young and she says what she thinks: Caroline Wahl is topping Germany's bestseller lists with her novels. But she has also faced a public backlash.</summary><category term="Culture" /></entry><entry><title>Amanal Petros: From refugee to European champion</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:1ea5c43f16912fc8d07b404b180c35c27c0bd22aca18731970cfbc678a785db0</id><updated>2026-08-31T21:31:45Z</updated><published>2026-08-19T11:07:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/amanal-petros-from-refugee-to-european-champion/a-78428504--c7c332adab8e.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/amanal-petros-from-refugee-to-european-champion/a-78428504?maca=en-rss-en-ger-1023-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">Amanal Petros fled the Eritrean–Ethiopian war and came to Germany as a teenager. Now one of the world's top marathon runners, he recently won gold at the European Athletics Championships.</summary><category term="TOP STORIES" /></entry><entry><title>Bayern Munich's Jamal Musiala collapses on pitch again</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:b19dc0e7e6bc7b223f5f12948161ae53cf04adc59aca288e39e58c2614a5e7c2</id><updated>2026-08-31T21:31:45Z</updated><published>2026-08-19T10:22:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/bayern-munich-s-jamal-musiala-collapses-on-pitch-again/a-78426021--4f3678c0bd32.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/bayern-munich-s-jamal-musiala-collapses-on-pitch-again/a-78426021?maca=en-rss-en-ger-1023-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">One of Germany's top footballers has collapsed on the pitch for a second time in four days ahead of the new season. Bayern Munich's Jamal Musiala has said he has a "neurological dysfunction" that causes blackouts.</summary><category term="Sports" /></entry><entry><title>How Germany's Hyrox became a global fitness craze</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:1ae7021a3accac74e4b25864c60af00b00f8fca912eed243e7aebbdaffac3e63</id><updated>2026-08-31T21:31:45Z</updated><published>2026-08-18T09:52:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/how-germany-s-hyrox-became-a-global-fitness-craze/a-78074218--a6c218d1a3af.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/how-germany-s-hyrox-became-a-global-fitness-craze/a-78074218?maca=en-rss-en-ger-1023-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">Created in Germany and now a global success, Hyrox combines running and functional training into a unique format. How a German concept became an international sports phenomenon.</summary><category term="Sports" /></entry></feed>
